<title>USA: Roberts Pharmaceutical revises EPS, net unchanged.</title>
<headline>Roberts Pharmaceutical revises EPS, net unchanged.</headline>
<dateline>EATONTOWN, N.J. 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Roberts Pharmaceutical Corp said Wednesday it had revised its earnings per share for the third and fourth quarters of 1996 in order to comply with the Securities and Exchange Commission's new position on convertible preferred stock.</p>
<p>Roberts said the accounting change would have no effect on operating income and net income for the two quarters and full year.  </p>
<p>The company's recalculated 1996 earnings (loss) per share are as follows:</p>
<p>	   1Q	2Q	  3Q	   4Q	  YEAR</p>
<p>	$(.22)   $.12     $(.40)    $(1.83)     $(2.44).</p>
</text>
